        "text": "**Initiating Core Processing**\n\nI'm now shifting focus to the \"same-scenario\" scored files, with the helper files now established. The next steps involve processing `consume_event.py`, which focuses on message consumption from a managed subscription, and `dead_letter.py`, for handling failed messages. This includes the procedure for dead-lettering, which I am actively considering.\n\n\n**Focusing on Consumption**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on message consumption with `consume_event.py`, after finalizing the helper files. Following that, I'll be working on `dead_letter.py`, to handle failed messages, ensuring I acknowledge the originals and send them to the dead-letter topic. Batch publishing will come after those. I am starting with `consume_event.py`.\n\n\n",
