        "text": "**Shifting Focus: Later Steps**\n\nI've completed the \"same-scenario\" file work and am now transitioning to the \"later-step\" scored files. Specifically, I'm starting with `message_summary.py` to create a simple aggregation function for processing results, which should be straightforward. I'll then move on to `message_safety.py` to check for safety issues.\n\n\n**Beginning Aggregation Work**\n\nI'm now starting on the \"later-step\" files, shifting my attention to summarizing and aggregating results. The initial focus is `message_summary.py`. I've started developing a simple aggregation function there, taking results from several processed messages. I will then move on to other files.\n\n\n",
